 style="stroke: rgb(255, 0, 0); fill: rgb(255, 0, 0); stroke-width: 1px; display: none;"></ellipse><polygon points="13.5,10 16.5,10 15,11.5 " style="stroke: rgb(255, 0, 0); fill: rgb(255, 0, 0); stroke-width: 1px; display: none;"></polygon></g><polyline points="7,10 23,10 " class="polyline" name="polyline" style="stroke: #2196f3; fill: none; stroke-width: 1px;"></polyline></g><text class="draggable" name="text" x="30" y="18" r="0" rtemp="0" transform="rotate(0 30 18)" style="fill: rgb(255, 123, 0); font-weight: normal; font-style: italic; font-size: 14px; font-family: lighter;">Logic gates with switches and LEDs (Live simulation)</text><text class="draggable" name="text" x="400" y="65" r="0" rtemp="0" transform="rotate(0 400 65)" style="fill: rgb(100, 116, 139); font-weight: normal; font-style: italic; font-size: 12px; font-family: lighter;">NOT</text><text class="draggable" name="text" x="400" y="255" r="0" rtemp="0" transform="rotate(0 400 255)" style="fill: rgb(100, 116, 139); font-weight: normal; font-style: italic; font-size: 12px; font-family: lighter;">OR</text><text class="draggable" name="text" x="400" y="505" r="0" rtemp="0" transform="rotate(0 400 505)" style="fill: rgb(100, 116, 139); font-weight: normal; font-style: italic; font-size: 12px; font-family: lighter;">NOR</text><text class="draggable" name="text" x="400" y="755" r="0" rtemp="0" transform="rotate(0 400 755)" style="fill: rgb(100, 116, 139); font-weight: normal; font-style: italic; font-size: 12px; font-family: lighter;">XOR</text><text class="draggable" name="text" x="400" y="1005" r="0" rtemp="0" transform="rotate(0 400 1005)" style="fill: rgb(100, 116, 139); font-weight: normal; font-style: italic; font-size: 12px; font-family: lighter;">XNOR</text><g transform="translate(760,20)" x="760" y="20" title="codeHTML" width="560" height="419" class="codeHTML" name="codeHTML" rot="0"><foreignObject x="0" y="0" width="560" height="419" style="width: 560px; height: 419px;"><div name="htmlCode" style="zoom: 0.56; height: 748.214px; width: 1000px;" code="&lt;div class=&quot;ch&quot;&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Logic Gates with Switches and LEDs (Live simulation)&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;ch-card&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;How to use&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Open the &lt;strong&gt;Live Simulation&lt;/strong&gt; panel and press &lt;strong&gt;Run&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Click the &lt;strong&gt;SPST switches&lt;/strong&gt; (S1 ... S9): closed = logic 1 (5 V), open = logic 0 (a 10 k&amp;Omega; pull-down resistor holds the input low).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Each gate drives a &lt;strong&gt;LED&lt;/strong&gt; through a 330 &amp;Omega; resistor: the LED lights when the output is 1.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;Circuit&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;V1:&lt;/strong&gt; 5 V supply, shared by all the switches through one wire.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;S1 ... S9:&lt;/strong&gt; SPST switch between the supply and the gate input (model SwitchSPST, parameter &lt;code&gt;state&lt;/code&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rp:&lt;/strong&gt; 10 k&amp;Omega; pull-down resistor on every input.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gates:&lt;/strong&gt; NOT, OR, NOR, XOR and XNOR of &lt;code&gt;Gates.py&lt;/code&gt; (digital models, logic family 0 V / 5 V).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rl and D:&lt;/strong&gt; 330 &amp;Omega; resistor and LED (model &lt;code&gt;LED.py&lt;/code&gt; in this folder, parameter &lt;code&gt;lit&lt;/code&gt; shown by the LED widget).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;Truth tables&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;table style=&quot;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;padding:2px 10px&quot;&gt;A&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;padding:2px 10px&quot;&gt;B&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;padding:2px 10px&quot;&gt;OR&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;padding:2px 10px&quot;&gt;NOR&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;padding:2px 10px&quot;&gt;XOR&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;padding:2px 10px&quot;&gt;XNOR&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;0&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;0&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;0&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;1&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;0&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;1&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;0&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;1&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;1&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;0&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;1&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;0&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;1&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;0&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;1&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;0&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;1&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;0&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;1&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;1&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;1&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;0&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;0&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;1&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p&gt;NOT: A = 0 gives 1 (LED on) and A = 1 gives 0 (LED off).&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;Things to try&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;With both switches of an XOR open the LED is off: close one and it lights, close both and it goes off again.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;NOR and XNOR light the LED when all the switches are open (the output is 1 at input 00).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The LED current is about (4.3 V &amp;minus; 1.8 V) / 330 &amp;Omega; &amp;asymp; 7.5 mA; the gate output resistance is 100 &amp;Omega;, so the output level is a little under 5 V while the LED is on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
"> 
